Alembic migration environment for the calorie tracker.

The database URL is read from the DATABASE_URL environment variable (see env.py);
alembic.ini deliberately leaves sqlalchemy.url blank.

Usage (from the ``backend/`` directory):

    alembic upgrade head                        # apply all migrations
    alembic downgrade -1                        # roll back one revision
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "msg"    # create a new revision

Migrations are executed automatically on backend container startup before the
API begins serving traffic.
